Project: EduXpert — Plateforme d'apprentissage intelligente
Developed by: Aymen Ben Abdellatif / Sarra Ayari / Beya farah ben romdhane
Institution: IMSET
Year: 2026

About this project:
EduXpert is an AI-powered learning platform built as a final year project (PFF).
It combines adaptive course learning with AI-generated quizzes, interview simulation
using voice AI and speech recognition, an intelligent EduBot assistant, and a
gamified dashboard with XP points and achievement badges.
The platform supports both dark and light themes and is powered by a local AI
model (Ollama/llama3.2) to ensure privacy and zero API cost.

Stack: React 18 + Vite, Node.js + Express, MySQL, Ollama/llama3.2

